  "description": "The Packer template (minimum version\u202f1.9.0) is described as an \u201cExample Packer template for Ubuntu VM using Vagrant and VirtualBox.\u201d It defines two variables \u2013\u202faws_region set to **us-west-2** and\u202fssh_username set to **ubuntu** \u2013 which can be referenced elsewhere in the build.  \n\nThe first builder is of type **vagrant** and uses the box **hashicorp/bionic64** at version **20220701.0.0**. It writes its output to the directory **output-vagrant**, does not skip adding the box (skip_add\u202f=\u202ffalse), and builds from the source path **src/** using the template file **Vagrantfile.template**. The second builder is a **virtualbox-iso** builder targeting an Ubuntu\u202f64\u2011bit guest (guest_os_type\u202f=\u202fUbuntu_64). It downloads the ISO from **http://releases.ubuntu.com/20.04/ubuntu-20.04-live-server-amd64.iso** and verifies it with the checksum **sha256:93b8958e3d12810e8f8fdfd9425ce3e74014573b7e9ef6147a7cacc9d0f248e5**. The virtual disk is sized at **40960\u202fMB**, the VM runs headless, is named **ubuntu20-virtualbox**, and its files are placed in **output-virtualbox**. The VM will be shut down with the command `echo 'packer' | sudo -S shutdown -P now`, and an HTTP server for provisioning files is served from the **http** directory.  \n\nA single shell provisioner runs two inline commands: `sudo apt-get update` followed by `sudo apt-get install -y nginx`. After the build, two post\u2011processors are applied: first a built\u2011in **compress** step, then an upload step named **s3-upload** that sends the artifact to **s3://my-bucket/packer-images/**, keeps the input artifact, applies only to the **virtualbox-iso** builder, packages the output as a **tar.gz** archive, and uses a compression level of **9**.",
  "reference_json": {
    "min_packer_version": "1.9.0",
    "description": "Example Packer template for Ubuntu VM using Vagrant and VirtualBox.",
    "variables": {
      "aws_region": "us-west-2",
      "ssh_username": "ubuntu"
    },
    "builders": [
      {
        "type": "vagrant",
        "box_name": "hashicorp/bionic64",
        "box_version": "20220701.0.0",
        "output_dir": "output-vagrant",
        "skip_add": false,
        "source_path": "src/",
        "template": "Vagrantfile.template"
      },
      {
        "type": "virtualbox-iso",
        "guest_os_type": "Ubuntu_64",
        "iso_url": "http://releases.ubuntu.com/20.04/ubuntu-20.04-live-server-amd64.iso",
        "iso_checksum": "sha256:93b8958e3d12810e8f8fdfd9425ce3e74014573b7e9ef6147a7cacc9d0f248e5",
        "disk_size": 40960,
        "headless": true,
        "vm_name": "ubuntu20-virtualbox",
        "output_directory": "output-virtualbox",
        "shutdown_command": "echo 'packer' | sudo -S shutdown -P now",
        "http_directory": "http"
      }
    ],
    "provisioners": [
      {
        "type": "shell",
        "inline": [
          "sudo apt-get update",
          "sudo apt-get install -y nginx"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "post-processors": [
      "compress",
      {
        "type": "upload",
        "name": "s3-upload",
        "endpoint": "s3://my-bucket/packer-images/",
        "keep_input_artifact": true,
        "only": [
          "virtualbox-iso"
        ],
        "format": "tar.gz",
        "compression_level": 9
      }
    ]
  }
}